  "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-10.html": {
   "file": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-10.html",
   "quest": 178,
   "text": "Icon of the Present: ######################## N: I assume you have heard of it as well? Though it is no longer the case, this Isle of Souls was once sealed, hidden between dimensions... Why do you suppose it was sealed? The other races believe that it was because of the Kamael's exceptional combat …",
   "header": "Icon of the Present",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Does that mean there was another reason?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00178_IconicTrinity 32256-11.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00178_IconicTrinity",
     "event": "32256-11.html",
     "quest": 178,
     "to": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-11.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-11.html": {
   "file": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-11.html",
   "quest": 178,
   "text": "Icon of the Present: ######################## %name1%: Does that mean there was another reason? N: Between dimensions, away from prying eyes... Is it not natural to surmise that the true purpose was to hide this Isle of Souls? ########################",
   "header": "Icon of the Present",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Hide it from who?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00178_IconicTrinity 32256-12.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00178_IconicTrinity",
     "event": "32256-12.html",
     "quest": 178,
     "to": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-12.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-12.html": {
   "file": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-12.html",
   "quest": 178,
   "text": "Icon of the Present: ######################## %name1%: Then was this Isle of Souls sealed between dimensions in order to hide it from someone? N: That is was it recorded in the Kamael's \"Lost History.\" To continue... This Isle of Souls was sealed between dimensions because if it had been left in th…",
   "header": "Icon of the Present",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Then...a god?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00178_IconicTrinity 32256-13.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00178_IconicTrinity",
     "event": "32256-13.html",
     "quest": 178,
     "to": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-13.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-13.html": {
   "file": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-13.html",
   "quest": 178,
   "text": "Icon of the Present: ######################## %name1%: Then...a god? N: Perhaps. Or at least an equal of the gods. ########################",
   "header": "Icon of the Present",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "\"Why did the Kamael have to hide themselves in the first place?\"",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00178_IconicTrinity 32256-14.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00178_IconicTrinity",
     "event": "32256-14.html",
     "quest": 178,
     "to": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-14.html",
     "effect": "cond:3"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-14.html": {
   "file": "Q00178_IconicTrinity/32256-14.html",
   "quest": 178,
   "text": "Icon of the Present: ######################## %name1%: Why did the Kamael have to hide themselves in the first place? N: I cannot tell you that now. You will know later, when you have advanced sufficiently to learn the Kamael's \"Lost History.\" Our story here is finished. Find the Icon of the Future…",
   "header": "Icon of the Present",
   "sets": {
    "cond": "3"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
